From 40c23ffc77951958c92e816f035c0518e1d924d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: add quorum node-count and circulating-supply
 activation gates

Enforce >= 8 quorum nodes and >= 10% circulating supply (or 1,000,000 XPI
dev floor) before activating staking rewards, treasury, or preconsensus
policies, freeze the speculative Merklix overlay upon finalizeMempoolBatch,
and add unit tests in processor_tests.cpp and preconsensus_batch_tests.cpp.
---
